WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.101 --> 00:00:04.751
The moon's orbit is tilted about five degrees, so eclipses are rare.

2
00:00:05.677 --> 00:00:09.677
At every new moon, the moon passes between the Earth and the sun.

3
00:00:16.105 --> 00:00:21.155
But its orbit is tilted about five degrees, so its shadow usually misses.

4
00:00:27.456 --> 00:00:31.381
An eclipse needs a new or full moon right where the orbits cross.
